# Ticket 01 Scenario
## Scenario
A customer complains that a text file "report.txt" they created won't let them read or edit it.

## Context
The directory and file was made by me but was modified and edited to create a scenario or possibility where a customer happens to run an issue where their file can't be accessed.

## Objective
- Investigate file permissions
- Identify permissions of owner, group, and others
- Determine why the file can't be accessed
- Correct the permission issue

## Finding the file
Using ls -l, I searched and displayed the directories that were within the terminal. I then used cd Troubleshootinglab to change directories into the 'Troubleshootinglab' directory and then used ls to display all the files in the directory and found the 'report.txt' file.

rpsecurity100@Thebigmac:~$ ls -l
total 44
